---
const sectors = [
  "CBSE School", "600K Creator", "Tour Operator",
  "Moto Brand", "Booking Platform", "Solar Contractor",
];
---
<section id="about" class="about-bare">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <h2>Solo. On purpose.</h2>
    <p>One person · start to finish · anywhere in the world</p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-bare-grid">
    <figure class="about-portrait">
      <img src="https://ik.imagekit.io/dn2zdxiu3/Portfolioprojectimages/divyansh.webp" alt="Divyansh Sood — independent web designer and developer" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption>
        <strong>Divyansh Sood</strong>
        <span>Independent web studio · India</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="about-bare-text">
      <p>Every site you see here — designed and built by me. From the first sketch to the deployed URL. One person, start to finish.</p>
      <p>Independent web studio. Async-friendly, video calls when useful. Open to projects worldwide — half my clients aren't in India.</p>
      <p class="about-built-for">
        <span class="about-built-for-label">Built for</span>
        {sectors.join(" · ")}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
